; Atomic Bomberman's second player on a second DualSense (the pad of another
; signed-in PS5 user), as the game's second key set, Key 1: the d-pad moves
; (R, G, F, D), Cross drops a bomb (S) and Circle is the action key (A).
; Choose Key 1 for that player in the game. Needs a prospero-win with
; [input] player2.
[input]
mode = keyboard
mouse = none
up = r
right = g
down = f
left = d
cross = s
circle = a
square = s
triangle = a
